{"id":"5151","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/5151_main_stratocumulus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds-hydrometeors.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>图为<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">形成的薄层层积云</span>, 至少部分是积雨云扩散造成的；母积雨云上部被层积云遮挡。由于母云是积雨云，因此，我们可添加描述词积雨云性。小冰雹式降水可表明出现了厚度大于层积云的积雨云，在云底之下可见。这是 <span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">降水性附加特征</span>。在层积云之下以及降水柱右侧可见的积状云有边界清晰的扁平云底，低于周围层积云的云底。在远处可见部分被遮掩的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">有平顶云砧（砧状）的鬃积雨云</span>，而<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">层积云块</span>与积雨云无关。</p>\n<p> </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Matthew Clark","location":"英国，德文郡，埃克塞特，Nadderwater","latitude":"纬度: 50° 44' 23'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 34' 54'' W","date":"19 February 2010 1720 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东北","cloudCode":"CL= 9, CM= 0, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.7.24","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.7.24"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/5151_syn_stratocumulus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds-hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>1800UTC地面图显示出北海上空984 hPa的低压,中心在丹麦以西。不列颠群岛处于极地海洋气团的影响之下，表征为低压环流中的弱西北气流。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/5151_upper_stratocumulus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds-hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从英国英格兰坎伯恩1200UTC进行的探测（WMO 03808）具有极地海洋气流代表性，探测显示出从地面到350 hPa的对流层顶的条件性不稳定但相当干燥的大气。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/radar/5151_radar_stratocumulus-cumulonimbogenitus_clouds-hydrometeors.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>图为英国气象局1730UTC降雨雷达拼图，图上红箭头标示出照片中的阵雨。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇家版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"",